OL,3,GNEWSADunwich Heath wildfire cause
OL,4,Aundetermined
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cause of a huge wildfire that
OL,7,Fdestroyed parts of a nature reserve
OL,8,Fcould not be determined, according to a
OL,9,Ffire service.
OL,11,FLarge parts of Dunwich Heath and of the
OL,12,Fneighbouring RSPB Minsmere on the
OL,13,FSuffolk coast were destroyed by a fire
OL,14,Fthe size of 210 football pitches, which
OL,15,Fstarted on 29 July.
OL,17,FIt took Suffolk Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Ftwo weeks to stand down from the scene
OL,19,Fand while investigations have
OL,20,Fidentified where the fire originated,
OL,21,Fits cause remained undetermined.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
